   "sender": "972 Education Inc. Orly",
   "text": "יצרתי בוט שילמד עברית בגישה התפקודית. אשמח מאוד מאוד שתתרגלו עם הבוט ותשתפו עם אחרים/ות ואשמח עוד יותר לקבל משוב על חווית השימוש בבוט כמו כן הערות מקצועיות ובונות. \n🌟 Introducing  ״המורה אור-לי״ \"Teacher Or-Ly\" - Your #AIHebrewLearningCompanion ! 🇮🇱 \nAfter 30 years of teaching Hebrew as a Second Language worldwide, I'm thrilled to announce the launch of my FREE Hebrew practice bot available 24/7 on ChatGPT ! 🤖✨\nWhat makes this #bot special? 🎯 Based on ACTFL functional approach & real teaching expertise 📚 Adapts to ALL levels - Beginner to Advanced 🎨 Interactive with emojis & visual aids 💬 Real #Hebrew practice in everyday situations 🔤 Choose Hebrew with or without vowels (nikud) 🌍 Accessible to learners worldwide, anytime!\nWhy I created this? I believe Hebrew should be accessible to everyone. No matter where you are in the world, what time it is, or what your level, now you have a personal #Hebrewteacher in your pocket!\nThis isn't just technology, it's a #culturalbridge connecting people to #Hebrewlanguage and #Israeliculture with #love and #respect 💙\nReady to try? Search for \"המורה אור-לי\" on ChatGPT and start learning Hebrew today! 🚀 or just click on the link in the comments below 👇\n\nWant personal lessons with the real me? Always here for you! 📱\n\n\"Language is a bridge between hearts, and now this bridge is open to all!\" 💫\n\nOrly\n\n#Hebrew #LanguageLearning #AI #Education #Israel #HebrewTeacher #972education #hebrewteacherbot #actfl #chatgpt #proficiency #langchat",
